* text=auto eol=lf
*.gd text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.cfg text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.tscn text eol=lf
*.tres text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ttf binary

# The source archive (GitHub's "Download ZIP" and the archive of a commit, which the Godot Asset
# Library installs from) holds only the addons, LICENSE and README.md. Everything else stays in
# the repository: tools/check_source_archive.sh checks this, and docs/RELEASE.md explains it.
/**                 export-ignore
/addons             !export-ignore
/addons/**          !export-ignore
/addons/wyrd        export-ignore
/addons/wyrd/**     export-ignore
/addons/gut         export-ignore
/addons/gut/**      export-ignore
/LICENSE            !export-ignore
/README.md          !export-ignore
